{
  "id": "aicte-grant-finder-workflow",
  "name": "AICTE AI Grant & Funding Finder",
  "description": "Langflow workflow: Startup profile input → Rule-based filter → IBM Granite AI scoring → Ranked grant matches → Proposal generation",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "data": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "startup_input",
        "type": "TextInputNode",
        "position": { "x": 50, "y": 200 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "Startup Profile Input",
            "description": "Enter your startup details as JSON or plain text",
            "base_classes": ["Text"],
            "template": {
              "input_value": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Startup Profile (JSON)",
                "value": "{\n  \"name\": \"TechBridge AI\",\n  \"domain\": \"EdTech\",\n  \"stage\": \"mvp\",\n  \"location_state\": \"Karnataka\",\n  \"location_country\": \"India\",\n  \"dpiit_recognized\": true,\n  \"keywords\": [\"AI\", \"education\", \"NLP\", \"B2B\"],\n  \"description\": \"AI-powered adaptive learning platform for K-12 students\",\n  \"founding_year\": 2022,\n  \"team_size\": 8\n}",
                "required": true
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "text", "display_name": "Startup Profile", "types": ["Text"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "grant_database",
        "type": "TextInputNode",
        "position": { "x": 50, "y": 450 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "Grant Database",
            "description": "Available grants from the AICTE/DPIIT/DST database",
            "base_classes": ["Text"],
            "template": {
              "input_value": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Grants List (JSON)",
                "value": "[\n  {\"id\": \"birac-bigi\", \"title\": \"BIRAC BIGI Grant\", \"provider\": \"BIRAC\", \"domains\": [\"Biotech\", \"HealthTech\"], \"stages\": [\"prototype\", \"mvp\"], \"locations\": [\"India\"], \"funding_max\": 5000000, \"deadline\": \"2025-06-30\", \"requirements\": [\"DPIIT registered\"]},\n  {\"id\": \"dst-nidhi\", \"title\": \"DST NIDHI PRAYAS\", \"provider\": \"DST\", \"domains\": [\"All domains\"], \"stages\": [\"idea\", \"prototype\"], \"locations\": [\"India\"], \"funding_max\": 1000000, \"deadline\": \"2025-05-31\", \"requirements\": []},\n  {\"id\": \"meity-tide\", \"title\": \"MeitY TIDE 2.0\", \"provider\": \"MeitY\", \"domains\": [\"AI/ML\", \"IoT\", \"EdTech\"], \"stages\": [\"mvp\", \"early_stage\"], \"locations\": [\"India\"], \"funding_max\": 3000000, \"deadline\": \"2025-07-15\", \"requirements\": [\"DPIIT registered\"]},\n  {\"id\": \"atal-bridge\", \"title\": \"Atal Innovation Bridge\", \"provider\": \"AIM NITI Aayog\", \"domains\": [\"All domains\"], \"stages\": [\"idea\", \"prototype\", \"mvp\"], \"locations\": [\"India\"], \"funding_max\": 2000000, \"deadline\": \"2025-08-31\", \"requirements\": []}\n]",
                "required": true
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "text", "display_name": "Grants JSON", "types": ["Text"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "rule_filter_prompt",
        "type": "PromptNode",
        "position": { "x": 380, "y": 300 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "Rule-Based Filter Prompt",
            "description": "Builds a prompt to filter grants by domain, stage, location",
            "base_classes": ["Prompt"],
            "template": {
              "template": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Prompt Template",
                "value": "You are a grant eligibility filter. Given the startup profile and grants list, filter and score each grant using these rules:\n\n**Scoring Rules (0-100):**\n- Domain match: +30 points\n- Stage match: +25 points\n- Location match: +20 points\n- DPIIT recognized: +10 points (if grant requires it)\n- Keyword overlap: +3 points per matching keyword (max 15)\n\n**Startup Profile:**\n{startup_profile}\n\n**Available Grants:**\n{grants_list}\n\nReturn a JSON array of objects:\n[\n  {{\n    \"grant_id\": \"<id>\",\n    \"grant_title\": \"<title>\",\n    \"rule_score\": <0-100>,\n    \"domain_match\": <true/false>,\n    \"stage_match\": <true/false>,\n    \"location_match\": <true/false>,\n    \"dpiit_bonus\": <true/false>,\n    \"keyword_overlap\": [\"<kw1>\", \"<kw2>\"],\n    \"strong_matches\": [\"<reason1>\"],\n    \"missing_criteria\": [\"<gap1>\"]\n  }}\n]\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON array, no explanation."
              },
              "startup_profile": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Startup Profile",
                "value": ""
              },
              "grants_list": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Grants List",
                "value": ""
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "prompt", "display_name": "Filter Prompt", "types": ["Prompt"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ibm_granite_filter",
        "type": "WatsonxLLM",
        "position": { "x": 700, "y": 200 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "IBM Granite – Rule Scoring",
            "description": "IBM watsonx.ai Granite model for rule-based pre-filtering",
            "base_classes": ["LanguageModel"],
            "template": {
              "model_id": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Model ID",
                "value": "ibm/granite-13b-chat-v2"
              },
              "project_id": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "watsonx Project ID",
                "value": "",
                "password": true
              },
              "api_key": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "IBM Cloud API Key",
                "value": "",
                "password": true
              },
              "url": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "watsonx URL",
                "value": "https://us-south.ml.cloud.ibm.com"
              },
              "max_new_tokens": {
                "type": "int",
                "display_name": "Max New Tokens",
                "value": 800
              },
              "temperature": {
                "type": "float",
                "display_name": "Temperature",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              "decoding_method": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Decoding Method",
                "value": "greedy"
              },
              "repetition_penalty": {
                "type": "float",
                "display_name": "Repetition Penalty",
                "value": 1.1
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "text", "display_name": "Rule-Scored Grants JSON", "types": ["Text"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ai_scoring_prompt",
        "type": "PromptNode",
        "position": { "x": 700, "y": 450 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "AI Scoring Prompt",
            "description": "Deep AI match scoring prompt for top rule-based candidates (score ≥ 30)",
            "base_classes": ["Prompt"],
            "template": {
              "template": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Prompt Template",
                "value": "You are a grant matching expert. Evaluate how well this startup matches each filtered grant.\n\n**Startup Profile:**\n{startup_profile}\n\n**Pre-filtered Grants (rule score ≥ 30):**\n{filtered_grants}\n\nFor each grant provide a deep AI match score from 0 to 100 by evaluating:\n- Problem-solution fit with grant objectives\n- Technology alignment and innovation level\n- Market impact potential\n- Team capability indicators\n- Funding utilization likelihood\n\nBlend: Final Score = (rule_score × 0.4) + (ai_score × 0.6)\n\nReturn a JSON array sorted by final_score descending:\n[\n  {{\n    \"grant_id\": \"<id>\",\n    \"grant_title\": \"<title>\",\n    \"rule_score\": <0-100>,\n    \"ai_score\": <0-100>,\n    \"final_score\": <0-100>,\n    \"explanation\": \"<2-3 sentence reasoning>\",\n    \"strong_matches\": [\"<strength1>\", \"<strength2>\"],\n    \"missing_criteria\": [\"<gap1>\", \"<gap2>\"]\n  }}\n]\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON array, ranked best match first."
              },
              "startup_profile": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Startup Profile",
                "value": ""
              },
              "filtered_grants": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Pre-filtered Grants",
                "value": ""
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "prompt", "display_name": "AI Scoring Prompt", "types": ["Prompt"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ibm_granite_scoring",
        "type": "WatsonxLLM",
        "position": { "x": 1000, "y": 350 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "IBM Granite – AI Match Scoring",
            "description": "IBM Granite deep semantic scoring (60% weight in final score)",
            "base_classes": ["LanguageModel"],
            "template": {
              "model_id": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Model ID",
                "value": "ibm/granite-13b-chat-v2"
              },
              "project_id": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "watsonx Project ID",
                "value": "",
                "password": true
              },
              "api_key": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "IBM Cloud API Key",
                "value": "",
                "password": true
              },
              "url": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "watsonx URL",
                "value": "https://us-south.ml.cloud.ibm.com"
              },
              "max_new_tokens": {
                "type": "int",
                "display_name": "Max New Tokens",
                "value": 1000
              },
              "temperature": {
                "type": "float",
                "display_name": "Temperature",
                "value": 0.2
              },
              "decoding_method": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Decoding Method",
                "value": "greedy"
              },
              "repetition_penalty": {
                "type": "float",
                "display_name": "Repetition Penalty",
                "value": 1.1
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "text", "display_name": "AI-Scored Ranked Results", "types": ["Text"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "proposal_prompt",
        "type": "PromptNode",
        "position": { "x": 1000, "y": 600 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "Proposal Generation Prompt",
            "description": "Generates a structured grant application proposal for the top-matched grant",
            "base_classes": ["Prompt"],
            "template": {
              "template": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Prompt Template",
                "value": "You are an expert grant writer helping a startup apply for funding.\nWrite a professional grant application proposal draft.\n\nStartup Profile:\n- Name: {startup_name}\n- Domain: {startup_domain}\n- Stage: {startup_stage}\n- Description: {startup_description}\n- Location: {startup_location}\n- DPIIT Recognized: {dpiit_recognized}\n- Keywords: {startup_keywords}\n\nGrant Details:\n- Title: {grant_title}\n- Provider: {grant_provider}\n- Description: {grant_description}\n- Requirements: {grant_requirements}\n- Funding Range: {funding_range}\n\nAdditional Context:\n{additional_context}\n\nWrite a structured proposal with the following sections:\n1. Executive Summary\n2. Problem Statement\n3. Proposed Solution\n4. Innovation & Technology\n5. Market Opportunity\n6. Team & Capacity\n7. Budget Justification\n8. Expected Impact\n9. Conclusion\n\nUse professional language. Keep the proposal factual and compelling."
              },
              "startup_name": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Startup Name", "value": "" },
              "startup_domain": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Domain", "value": "" },
              "startup_stage": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Stage", "value": "" },
              "startup_description": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Description", "value": "" },
              "startup_location": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Location", "value": "" },
              "dpiit_recognized": { "type": "str", "display_name": "DPIIT", "value": "" },
              "startup_keywords": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Keywords", "value": "" },
              "grant_title": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Grant Title", "value": "" },
              "grant_provider": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Provider", "value": "" },
              "grant_description": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Grant Description", "value": "" },
              "grant_requirements": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Requirements", "value": "" },
              "funding_range": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Funding Range", "value": "" },
              "additional_context": { "type": "str", "display_name": "Additional Context", "value": "" }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "prompt", "display_name": "Proposal Prompt", "types": ["Prompt"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ibm_granite_proposal",
        "type": "WatsonxLLM",
        "position": { "x": 1300, "y": 600 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "IBM Granite – Proposal Writer",
            "description": "IBM Granite generates a full structured grant proposal (max 1500 tokens)",
            "base_classes": ["LanguageModel"],
            "template": {
              "model_id": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Model ID",
                "value": "ibm/granite-13b-chat-v2"
              },
              "project_id": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "watsonx Project ID",
                "value": "",
                "password": true
              },
              "api_key": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "IBM Cloud API Key",
                "value": "",
                "password": true
              },
              "url": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "watsonx URL",
                "value": "https://us-south.ml.cloud.ibm.com"
              },
              "max_new_tokens": {
                "type": "int",
                "display_name": "Max New Tokens",
                "value": 1500
              },
              "temperature": {
                "type": "float",
                "display_name": "Temperature",
                "value": 0.4
              },
              "decoding_method": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Decoding Method",
                "value": "greedy"
              },
              "repetition_penalty": {
                "type": "float",
                "display_name": "Repetition Penalty",
                "value": 1.1
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "text", "display_name": "Generated Proposal", "types": ["Text"] }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "output_ranked",
        "type": "TextOutputNode",
        "position": { "x": 1300, "y": 350 },
        "data": {
          "node": {
            "display_name": "Ranked Grant Matches",
            "description": "Final ranked list of grants with AI + rule-based scores",
            "base_classes": ["Text"],
            "template": {
              "input_value": {
                "type": "str",
                "display_name": "Ranked Results",
                "value": ""
              }
            },
            "outputs": [
              { "name": "text", "display_name": "Top Matched Grants", "types": ["Text"] }
            ]
